"patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105656.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-24T14:14:24Z"},"body":"Adds property to disable behavior of `LineEdit`, `TextEdit` and `CodeEdit` where backspace deletes into the mid grapheme of a composite character like ❤️‍🩹. Preserves backward compatibility by adding property `backspace_deletes_composite_character_enabled` disabled by default.\r\n\r\nAlso adds methods to correctly locate the column or caret location at the start or end of a composite character. This is required in order to detect in script, for example, that a composite character was typed by a user.\r\n\r\nBackspace in `LineEdit` and `TextEdit` before PR fix. The backspace key must be hit three times to delete all the way across the composite character:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f72f5c98-f509-40f7-acb1-c5a1022eb7f9\r\n\r\n\r\nWith PR fix and `backspace_deletes_composite_character_enabled` enabled:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7ef8ca2-1d7d-43a4-9c0d-72c72bae346e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"u